{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/52a5c8c691577bd837ef39f7baad6248.poster.avif?t=1759395625\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/52a5c8c691577bd837ef39f7baad6248.webm?t=1759395625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/52a5c8c691577bd837ef39f7baad6248.mp4?t=1759395625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Focus Grove</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work or study with the help of your Grovelings \u2014 little forest dwellers who live in rhythm with your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow in the Grove</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy game to keep you focused and motivated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your day becomes a balanced cycle of growth and rest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine real productivity tools with the calm joy of a cozy idle game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/a5b2a161cdfe141d7b12f6e0fdb877a9.poster.avif?t=1759395625\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/a5b2a161cdfe141d7b12f6e0fdb877a9.webm?t=1759395625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/a5b2a161cdfe141d7b12f6e0fdb877a9.mp4?t=1759395625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pomodoro Flow</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sessions follow the proven <i>Pomodoro technique</i> for focus work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work time</strong>: You focus on your tasks while Grovelings get busy building and farming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break time</strong>: Grovelings rest and recharge. You do you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Shed Full of Focus &amp; Balance Tools</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient nature sounds to create the perfect focus zone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Habits tracker to support consistency and growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily mindful prompts to boost your well-being.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Task tracker to keep your to-do list under control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick notepad for ideas and reminders.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Cozy Forest</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your Grovelings build your forest farm at the bottom of your screen while you work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your grove with new plants, trees, and decorations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock outfits for your Grovelings and create your own cozy style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030830?t=1759395625","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/612aeb64895cdb93a84d257196529206d2e1e975/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759395625","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/7b95178d7eedd0186f17dd4f6c62bcedf5b029e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759395625","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/7b95178d7eedd0186f17dd4f6c62bcedf5b02